{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/appium' data-target='computer\/program\/appium' data-title='Appium'>\r\n\t\t\tAppium\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Installation: Install nodejs/npm, Install grunt-cli, Install Appium, Set up a symlink in your .bashrc file for Appium, and If required.","label":"Installation","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/appium\/eclipse","label":"Eclipse","url":"\/computer\/program\/appium\/eclipse"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Install nodejs\/npm<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSudo apt-get update.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>sudo apt-get install -y python-software-properties python g++ make<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSudo add-apt-repository ppa:chris-lea\/node.js.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSudo apt-get update.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSudo apt-get install nodejs.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNpm config set prefix ~\/npm.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAnd adding $HOME\/npm\/bin to $PATH.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAppend to .bashrc.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tExports PATH=\"$PATH:$HOME\/npm\/bin\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Install grunt-cli<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>npm install -g grunt-cli<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Install Appium<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>npm install -g appium<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Set up a symlink in your .bashrc file for Appium<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ln -s \/path\/to\/appium.js \/usr\/bin\/appium<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAppium.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>If required<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEither place a_.json file or.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRun reset.sh (https:\/\/github.com\/appium\/appium\/blob\/master\/reset.sh).\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/appium\/installation\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/appium\/installation\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/appium\/eclipse' data-target='computer\/program\/appium\/eclipse' data-title='Eclipse' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/program\/appium\/eclipse.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Eclipse<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/appium' data-target='computer\/program\/appium' data-title='Appium'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Appium<\/div><div class='arrow'>&